    {
      "name": "Dir",
      "summary": "Dir returns all but the last element of path, typically the path's directory. After dropping the final element, Dir calls [Clean] on the path and trailing slashes are removed. If the path is empty, Dir returns \".\". If the path consists entirely of separators, Dir returns a single separator. The returned path does not end in a separator unless it is the root directory.",
      "signature": "func Dir(path string) string",
